  "summary": "At a Bryan, Texas candidate forum, mayoral candidates discussed the city's use of Flock cameras. Incumbent Mayor Bobby Gutierrez defended the program, citing police support, while challenger Rafael D. Pe\u00f1a III said he would have voted against renewing funding, arguing Flock has lost public confidence.",
  "key_quotes": [
    {
      "quote": "We know our police officers love it; we know our officers talk about how it is. The last report I got, Flock is having to redo everything they are doing, and they have A.I. going in and checking everything,",
      "paragraph_idx": 5
    },
    {
      "quote": "In its current form, I do not believe that Flock is the right way to go. If it came before this council, I would have voted not to renew the funding, because I think it has lost the confidence of the people,",
      "paragraph_idx": 6
    }
  ],
